      "content": "i've been doing a lot of digging into the archives regarding the House of Valerius and the dissolution of the principality in the late 19th century. it's becoming more and more obvious that the line didn't actually end with the death of Prince Leopold, but was instead moved into hiding to protect the succession during the wars. i've found enough proof in the family records to confirm i am the direct descendant. i need to start making things official. how do i even begin to approach a foreign ministry to claim diplomatic status for a displaced sovereign lineage?",
